      "text": "struct captcha_data {\n\n    header_data: HeaderData,\n    interaction_data : InteractionData\n\n}\nstruct HeaderData {\n\n    //Headerdata of the POST request\n\n}\nstruct InteractionData {\n\n    //Visitor website interaction data\n\n}\n\nNote: Use /validate, to extract the JSON data of the POST\nrequest API endpoint and fill the strcuts listed above.\n",
