      "seed": 1082669048,
      "version": 846,
      "versionNonce": 823065336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793284594980,
      "created": 1793281300552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. on site-load, origin will send GET \"(/)init\"\nconsisting of:\n    - request IP of the user\n    - useragent\n    - timestamp\n    - origin\n            -> Server builds hash of named\nfields and return ray_id to the client. ray_id\nwill be used to track captcha progress, state\netc.\n\n2. client will send to \"/validate\":\n    - ray_id\n    - request IP\n    - origin\n    - data {webdriver, mobile, browsertype,\nwindow properties, mousedata, clickdata}\n    - timestamp\n\n3. server validates data, determines action,\nreturns POST data (/validate) to client\n4. client will serve visible/-invisible captcha\nto the visitor\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. on site-load, origin will send GET \"(/)init\" consisting of:\n    - request IP of the user\n    - useragent\n    - timestamp\n    - origin\n            -> Server builds hash of named fields and return ray_id to the client. ray_id will be used to track captcha progress, state etc.\n\n2. client will send to \"/validate\":\n    - ray_id\n    - request IP\n    - origin\n    - data {webdriver, mobile, browsertype, window properties, mousedata, clickdata}\n    - timestamp\n\n3. server validates data, determines action, returns POST data (/validate) to client\n4. client will serve visible/-invisible captcha to the visitor\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
